          "python",
          "Global vs Local Anomaly Detection\n=======================================================\n\nAnomaly near dense cluster [2, 2]:\n  KNN distance score: 1.9823\n  LOF score: 4.2156\n\nAnomaly near sparse cluster [8.5, 8.5]:\n  KNN distance score: 1.6431\n  LOF score: 1.7823\n\nKNN threshold (99th pctl): 2.1245\nLOF threshold: 1.5 (by convention)\n\nKNN detects anomaly near dense: False\nKNN detects anomaly near sparse: False\nLOF detects anomaly near dense: True\nLOF detects anomaly near sparse: True"
        ]
      ]
